Third-party software
--------------------
This repository does not include third-party source code. At run time it uses, without
modification, software and models installed separately under their own licences: the Ollama
model runner, the Qwen3.5 language model and, for the translation comparison only, IndicTrans2.
The AMR Console that starts it uses ROS 2 Jazzy, Nav2, SLAM Toolbox, Gazebo Harmonic, ros_gz and
the TurtleBot3 simulation models. Those licences apply to that software.
